  "slug": "subjuntivo-presente-querer",
  "titulo": "Conjugate querer in the present subjunctive",
  "subtitulo": "Quiera, quieras, queramos: ie everywhere except nosotros.",
  "foto": "t05.jpg",
  "regla": "Querer changes e > ie in the present subjunctive except in nosotros: quiera, quieras, quiera, queramos, quieran.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Querer** is a stem-changing verb: its first **e** becomes **ie** in the present, and the same change stays in the present subjunctive, **except in nosotros**. The endings are the regular **-er** ones."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "querer"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "quiera"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "quieras"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "quiera"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "queramos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "quieran"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **quiera** wants the **ie**; **queramos** is happy as it is."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Qué bueno que ==quieras== estudiar en la universidad.",
              "en": "It's great that you want to go to college."
            },
            {
              "es": "Es raro que no ==quiera== comer nada hoy.",
              "en": "It's weird that I don't want to eat anything today."
            },
            {
              "es": "Me extraña que Beto ==quiera== venir al cine.",
              "en": "I'm surprised Beto wants to come to the movies."
            },
            {
              "es": "Es sorprendente que todos ==queramos== ir a Oaxaca.",
              "en": "It's surprising that we all want to go to Oaxaca."
            },
            {
              "es": "Cociné para un ejército, así que espero que ==quieran== comer mucho.",
              "en": "I cooked for an army, so I hope you want to eat a lot."
            },
            {
              "es": "Dudo que ellas ==quieran== inscribirse al curso.",
              "en": "I doubt they'll want to sign up for the course."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
